      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "The company's revenue increased from {{m:revenue:FY-2}} in {{p:FY-2}} to {{m:revenue:LTM}} in {{p:LTM}}, with EBITDA of {{m:ebitda:LTM}} in {{p:LTM}}.",
