          "chunk_id": "HCA-000119312526044769-0004",
          "quote": "Our facilities are located in 19 states and England."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "The company also operated 121 freestanding ambulatory surgery centers and 31 freestanding endoscopy centers.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "HCA-000119312526044769-0004",
          "quote": "we operated 121 freestanding ambulatory surgery centers (“ASCs”) and 31 freestanding endoscopy centers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Increased competition, admission constraints, and third-party payer pressures are expected to continue, and third-party payer pre-admission authorization requirements have negatively affected admissions, average lengths of stay, and reimbursement amounts.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "HCA-000119312526044769-0079",
          "quote": "Increased competition, admission constraints and third-party payer pressures are expected to continue."
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "HCA-000119312526044769-0079",
          "quote": "Admissions, average lengths of stay and reimbursement amounts continue to be negatively affected by third-party payer pre-admission authorization requirements"
